WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.578
Roxy stared at the empty safe.

2
00:00:03.579 --> 00:00:06.495
"That woman robbed the safe!"

3
00:00:06.496 --> 00:00:08.635
She flew back outside.

4
00:00:08.636 --> 00:00:11.358
Detective Smith's coat lay on the sidewalk.

5
00:00:11.359 --> 00:00:16.201
A baby crawled out from under it. "Ba-ba-ba!"

6
00:00:16.202 --> 00:00:21.426
Roxy gasped. "Detective Smith—you're a baby!"

7
00:00:21.427 --> 00:00:27.021
Crash! Roxy spun around as a car rolled into a parked van.

8
00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:30.615
A baby stood behind the wheel, giggling.

9
00:00:30.616 --> 00:00:33.138
A man walked out of a store.

10
00:00:33.139 --> 00:00:36.830
"Where did all these babies come from?"

11
00:00:36.831 --> 00:00:41.521
A bus zipped by. It almost hit someone.

12
00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:44.415
A woman inside the bus yelled out of a window.

13
00:00:44.416 --> 00:00:51.542
"Help! The driver is a baby! She can't drive!"

14
00:00:51.543 --> 00:00:55.103
Zoom! Roxy shot after the bus.

15
00:00:55.104 --> 00:00:58.350
She flew inside and picked up the baby driver.

16
00:00:58.351 --> 00:01:03.827
Then she hit the brakes.

17
00:01:03.828 --> 00:01:06.437
Roxy and the woman gathered all the babies.

18
00:01:06.438 --> 00:01:11.646
They sat them on the sidewalk. "Whew!" Roxy said.

19
00:01:11.647 --> 00:01:18.429
"I need to tell Mayor Bloom what's happening," Roxy thought.

20
00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:20.626
She opened her watch.

21
00:01:20.627 --> 00:01:23.850
A baby was sitting in Mayor Bloom's chair.

22
00:01:23.851 --> 00:01:29.160
"Oh no!" Roxy cried. "Mayor Bloom is a baby too!"

23
00:01:29.161 --> 00:01:31.625
Roxy saw another baby nearby.

24
00:01:31.626 --> 00:01:35.520
He was chewing on a wallet.

25
00:01:35.521 --> 00:01:40.225
The baby dropped the wallet and crawled away.

26
00:01:40.226 --> 00:01:42.607
Roxy picked up the wallet.

27
00:01:42.608 --> 00:01:46.222
Inside was a business card: "Vanda's Day Spa.

28
00:01:46.223 --> 00:01:49.651
Our new treatment will take years off your life!"

29
00:01:49.652 --> 00:01:56.596
"That's the spa that Detective Smith went to!" Roxy said.

30
00:01:56.597 --> 00:02:00.242
A moment later Roxy arrived at Vanda's Day Spa.

31
00:02:00.243 --> 00:02:04.825
Two women walked out smiling.

32
00:02:04.826 --> 00:02:09.360
"That treatment was wonderful," one woman said.

33
00:02:09.361 --> 00:02:20.634
"We look fabulous!" the other said.

34
00:02:20.635 --> 00:02:24.699
Inside, Roxy saw a familiar woman behind the counter.

35
00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.731
"You were at Metro City Plumbing Supply!" Roxy cried.

36
00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:34.186
"You said you were Mr. Copper's daughter!"

37
00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:37.152
The woman walked toward Roxy.

38
00:02:37.153 --> 00:02:42.557
"My name is Vanda. Are you here for a treatment, Rocket Girl?"

39
00:02:42.558 --> 00:02:46.332
"No," Roxy said. "I—"

40
00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:50.551
The woman suddenly pushed Roxy into a chair.

41
00:02:50.552 --> 00:02:53.578
Click! Roxy was strapped in!

42
00:02:53.579 --> 00:02:57.375
A glass dome came down over her head.

43
00:02:57.376 --> 00:03:00.230
A hose connected the dome to a big tank.

44
00:03:00.231 --> 00:03:03.005
The tank was covered in frost.

45
00:03:03.006 --> 00:03:08.669
"What's going on?" Roxy struggled to get free.

46
00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:15.543
Vanda laughed. "My treatment turns people into babies.

47
00:03:15.544 --> 00:03:18.617
Then I can steal from them!"

48
00:03:18.618 --> 00:03:22.142
"I won't let you get away with this!" Roxy snapped.

49
00:03:22.143 --> 00:03:29.420
"Oh, yes, you will! I have a super dose of treatment ready for you!"

50
00:03:29.421 --> 00:03:33.371
Vanda pressed a button on the tank.

51
00:03:33.372 --> 00:03:37.292
A cold mist filled the dome.

52
00:03:37.293 --> 00:03:39.592
Roxy began to shrink.

53
00:03:39.593 --> 00:03:46.067
"Oh no! What's happening to me?

54
00:03:46.068 --> 00:03:51.147
Goo-goo! Ga-ga!"

